  "cover_text": "The results of the NOMAD crowd-sourced data analytics competition with classical, linked, GLAD and GRAD are available here\nUnderstanding large datasets, such as those generated by groundwater exploration, is essential for risk assessment. The workflow requires self-consistent modelling of the interactions between attributed wells, groundwater properties, groundwater signals in selected pixels, environmental datasets, and spatial analysis methods, among others.\nExisting groundwater routing modelling has, therefore, traditionally referred to various tools. Here, we present a software package for fast and comprehensive groundwater surface grading",
